Usage: codeintel build graph [ARGS]

Export Hamilton DAG for specified targets.

╭─ Parameters ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ TARGETS --targets     Target names to show DAG for (e.g., function_metrics,  │
│   --empty-targets     call_graph). [env var: CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_TARGETS,  │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_TARGETS] [default: (none)]       │
│ MODULE --module -m    Show DAG for all targets in a module (ingestion,       │
│                       graphs, analytics, export). [env var:                  │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_MODULE,                          │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_MODULE] [default: (none)]        │
│ ALL --all -a          Show DAG for all targets across all modules. [env var: │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_ALL, CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_ALL]  │
│                       [default: false]                                       │
│ FORMAT --format -f    Output format: json (default), mermaid, or dot. [env   │
│                       var: CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_FORMAT,                     │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_FORMAT] [default: json]          │
│ OUTPUT --output -o    Output file path (stdout if not specified). [env var:  │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_OUTPUT,                          │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_OUTPUT] [default: (none)]        │
│ *                     [env var: CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_*] [default: *]        │
│ ROOT --root -r        Explicit project root directory. [env var:             │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_ROOT,                            │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_ROOT] [default: (none)]          │
│ OUTPUT-FORMAT         Output format. [choices: text, json, jsonl] [env var:  │
│   --output-format     CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_OUTPUT_FORMAT,                   │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_OUTPUT_FORMAT] [default: text]   │
│ JSON --json           Alias for --output-format json. [env var:              │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_JSON,                            │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_JSON] [default: false]           │
│ VERBOSE --verbose -v  Increase verbosity (0=warnings, 1=info, 2=debug). [env │
│                       var: CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_VERBOSE,                    │
│                       CODEINTEL_BUILD_GRAPH_VERBOSE] [default: 0]            │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
